stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Free

    Free --> Held: claimLease(clientId) — holder is null: grant
    Held --> Held: claimLease(clientId) — same holder re-claims: refresh (seen_ms + alarm reset)
    Held --> Held: claimLease(otherClientId) — heartbeat is stale (now - seen >= LEASE_STALE_MS): stale-holder takeover
    Held --> Held: heartbeatLease(clientId) — same holder heartbeats: seen_ms updated, alarm re-armed
    Held --> Free: releaseLease(clientId) — same holder releases explicitly
    Held --> Free: expireIfStale() — alarm fires and heartbeat IS stale: expiry (freeLease)
    Held --> Held: expireIfStale() — alarm fires (or hub construction re-checks) and heartbeat is NOT yet stale: alarm re-arm
